purpose {
    An unobstructive validation layer for reqlan.
}

typed-reqlan {
    - Require specific attributes
    - constrain attributes to specific literals: e.g. status must be 
    - Require attribues of certain types (including nested types, includeing lists of nested types)
    - require references to other types
    - forbid references to other types
    - reference instances of types
    - reference instances of unions and intersections of types
    - filter by type

    @todo triage and implement
}

